From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 11:15:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: add streaming allocator and pipeline cache quirks for wwm.exe

Where Winds Meet (wwm.exe) benefits from bypassing host/device memory zeroing
during heavy level streaming, ignoring mismatched Windows-driver signatures in
application CachedPSO blobs, recycling command pools, and enforcing the global
persistent pipeline cache stream archive.

Rebased onto vkd3d-proton d6659d8b, which moved the application override
table from device_workarounds.c into vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json
(turned into a header by programs/generate_app_workarounds.py).
---
 libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json b/libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json
--- a/libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/vkd3d_proton_app_workarounds.json
@@ -29,6 +29,17 @@
       "SteamAppID" : "1245620"
     },
     {
+      "_comment": [
+        "Where Winds Meet (wwm.exe).",
+        "Skip memory zeroing during heavy level streaming, tolerate mismatched",
+        "driver signatures in application CachedPSO blobs without logging or errors,",
+        "recycle command pools to avoid allocator churn, and enforce the global",
+        "pipeline cache stream archive."
+      ],
+      "configEnable" : [ "MEMORY_ALLOCATOR_SKIP_CLEAR", "MEMORY_ALLOCATOR_SKIP_IMAGE_HEAP_CLEAR", "PIPELINE_LIBRARY_IGNORE_MISMATCH_DRIVER", "RECYCLE_COMMAND_POOLS", "GLOBAL_PIPELINE_CACHE", "NO_STAGGERED_SUBMIT" ],
+      "name" : "wwm.exe"
+    },
+    {
       "configEnable" : [ "FORCE_NO_INVARIANT_POSITION", "SMALL_VRAM_REBAR" ],
       "name" : "Sam4.exe"
     },
